sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as AI assistant
    participant Sandbox as NitroStack sandbox
    participant Tools as Application tools

    Agent->>Sandbox: Execute the investigation program
    Sandbox->>Tools: services_list()
    Tools-->>Sandbox: Service catalog
    loop For each service
        Sandbox->>Tools: metrics_compare(service)
        Tools-->>Sandbox: Before and after counts
        Note over Sandbox: Calculate and compare error rates
        opt Service meets the investigation rule
            Sandbox->>Tools: deployments_list(service)
            Tools-->>Sandbox: Deployment records
            Sandbox->>Tools: errors_sample(service)
            Tools-->>Sandbox: Error samples
        end
    end
    Sandbox-->>Agent: Selected findings
